Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {"", Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{"KtPlanoFlexionCambio", "[", 
       StyleBox[
        RowBox[{"D", ",", "r", ",", "h"}],
        FontSlant->"Italic"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula"],
     " \[LineSeparator]Calcula el concentrador de tensiones de una placa \
plana con un cambio de secci\[OAcute]n, al aplicarle un momento flector ",
     StyleBox["M",
      FontSlant->"Italic"],
     ". ",
     StyleBox["D",
      FontSlant->"Italic"],
     " es el ancho mayor, ",
     StyleBox["h",
      FontSlant->"Italic"],
     " es la semidiferencia entre el mayor y el menor,  ",
     StyleBox["r",
      FontSlant->"Italic"],
     " el radio de redondeo, y e el espesor de la placa. La tensi\[OAcute]n \
normal m\[AAcute]xima se calcula seg\[UAcute]n la f\[OAcute]rmula: ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "max"], "=", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["K", "t"], 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"6", "M"}], 
         RowBox[{"e", 
          SuperscriptBox[
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"D", "-", 
             RowBox[{"2", "h"}]}], ")"}], "3"]}]]}]}]], "InlineFormula"],
     ".\[LineSeparator]\[LineSeparator]Los valores predichos solo son \
adecuados dentro del rango: 0.1 \[LessSlantEqual] h/r \[LessSlantEqual] 20, y \
siempre y cuando: ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["L", "D"], ">", 
       FractionBox["0.8", 
        RowBox[{"r", "/", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"D", "-", 
            RowBox[{"2", "h"}]}], ")"}], "0.25"]}]]}]], "InlineFormula"],
     "\[LineSeparator]",
     Cell[BoxData[
      GraphicsBox[
       TagBox[RasterBox[CompressedData["
